   "roundness": null,
   "text": "PUSHED at every stage close and end of task; PULLABLE at any time.\nhave / need / progress for one rung AND the whole board \u2014 never\nprose. LIVENESS during a long task: landed \u00b7 in flight \u00b7 remaining\nat piece granularity, updated at every piece boundary, derived from\ndisk \u2014 motion vs hang without asking, never self-reported.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "PUSHED at every stage close and end of task; PULLABLE at any time.\nhave / need / progress for one rung AND the whole board \u2014 never\nprose. LIVENESS during a long task: landed \u00b7 in flight \u00b7 remaining\nat piece granularity, updated at every piece boundary, derived from\ndisk \u2014 motion vs hang without asking, never self-reported.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
