   "text": "every dispatching function declares tier + effort + why \u2014 sized\nAFTER the work is written, never before; never the top tier for\ndifficulty alone. wrong sizes surface to NO human: caught by the\npiece's own failing check, re-sized and re-dispatched by the roles.",
