   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "customData": {
    "gen": "kerd"
   },
   "roundness": null,
   "text": "a tool is staffed like a PLAYER. the driving role decides which\ntools are needed; every invocation carries a bounded contract \u2014 do\nthis, don't do that, return in this shape, to the CALLER. the tool\nnever names the next step. what is NOT adopted is named before\ninvocation. KILL authority over a rogue task \u2014 control from outside\nthe tool.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "a tool is staffed like a PLAYER. the driving role decides which\ntools are needed; every invocation carries a bounded contract \u2014 do\nthis, don't do that, return in this shape, to the CALLER. the tool\nnever names the next step. what is NOT adopted is named before\ninvocation. KILL authority over a rogue task \u2014 control from outside\nthe tool.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "t1038",
