   "roundness": null,
   "text": "REACHABLE \u2014 CLOSED 2026-08-04: an artifact is reachable when at least one function's declared\ngrounding names it, enforced by the entry gate. lost is a CHECKABLE state \u2014 an artifact in no\ngrounding list is lost by declaration. naming solves findability; grounding solves reachability.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 6,
